  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  speakerName: Shana
  DialogText:
  - 'As you can see that skill has applied a condition to you. You can hover over
    it to see what it does. The number underneath it indicates how many turns it
    will last. '
  - 'Some of your skills have special properties. On Even turns they have a certain
    effect, often more defensive focus and on Odd turns becoming more offensive.  '
  - 'Here now use Sword and Shield again and it should now deal damage and debuff
    your enemy.  '
